### Pages — the private console API (WorkflowContentApi via PageApi). Same shape for posts, banners, faq, policies.
### Vars: SELLER_UI_URL, STORE_ID, POD_ID, LANG, SESSION_ID from extra/requests/http-client.env.json

### List pages (status/locale/state/q filters, count = page size)
GET {{SELLER_UI_URL}}/spg/content/api/v1/private/content/pages?store={{STORE_ID}}&pod={{POD_ID}}&lang={{LANG}}&page=0&count=25&sort=updatedAt,desc
Cookie: SESSION={{SESSION_ID}}

### List only drafts with Arabic missing
GET {{SELLER_UI_URL}}/spg/content/api/v1/private/content/pages?store={{STORE_ID}}&pod={{POD_ID}}&lang={{LANG}}&status=DRAFT&locale=ar&state=MISSING
Cookie: SESSION={{SESSION_ID}}

### Is a slug free?
GET {{SELLER_UI_URL}}/spg/content/api/v1/private/content/pages/slug-available?slug=careers&store={{STORE_ID}}&pod={{POD_ID}}&lang={{LANG}}
Cookie: SESSION={{SESSION_ID}}

### Create a page (DRAFT)
POST {{SELLER_UI_URL}}/spg/content/api/v1/private/content/pages?store={{STORE_ID}}&pod={{POD_ID}}&lang={{LANG}}
Content-Type: application/json
Cookie: SESSION={{SESSION_ID}}

{
  "slug": "careers",
  "template": "STANDARD",
  "showInFooter": true,
  "linkToMenu": false,
  "noindex": false,
  "translations": [
    {"language": "en", "title": "Careers at Acme", "body": "<h2>Join us</h2><p>We are hiring.</p>", "metaDescription": "Open roles at Acme", "keywords": "jobs, careers"},
    {"language": "ar", "title": "الوظائف", "body": "<p>انضم إلينا</p>"}
  ]
}

### Read one page (all languages, version, locales, audit)
GET {{SELLER_UI_URL}}/spg/content/api/v1/private/content/pages/1?store={{STORE_ID}}&pod={{POD_ID}}&lang={{LANG}}
Cookie: SESSION={{SESSION_ID}}

### Update (send the version you read — a stale one is 409 CONTENT.VERSION.CONFLICT)
PUT {{SELLER_UI_URL}}/spg/content/api/v1/private/content/pages/1?store={{STORE_ID}}&pod={{POD_ID}}&lang={{LANG}}
Content-Type: application/json
Cookie: SESSION={{SESSION_ID}}

{
  "version": 1,
  "slug": "careers",
  "template": "STANDARD",
  "translations": [
    {"language": "en", "title": "Careers at Acme", "body": "<p>Updated.</p>"}
  ]
}

### Publish now
POST {{SELLER_UI_URL}}/spg/content/api/v1/private/content/pages/1/publish?store={{STORE_ID}}&pod={{POD_ID}}&lang={{LANG}}
Cookie: SESSION={{SESSION_ID}}

### Schedule (publishAt in the future → SCHEDULED; the job publishes it)
POST {{SELLER_UI_URL}}/spg/content/api/v1/private/content/pages/1/publish?store={{STORE_ID}}&pod={{POD_ID}}&lang={{LANG}}
Content-Type: application/json
Cookie: SESSION={{SESSION_ID}}

{"publishAt": "2026-12-01T09:00:00Z", "unpublishAt": "2027-01-01T00:00:00Z"}

### Submit for review / unpublish / archive / restore
POST {{SELLER_UI_URL}}/spg/content/api/v1/private/content/pages/1/submit-review?store={{STORE_ID}}&pod={{POD_ID}}&lang={{LANG}}
Cookie: SESSION={{SESSION_ID}}

###
POST {{SELLER_UI_URL}}/spg/content/api/v1/private/content/pages/1/unpublish?store={{STORE_ID}}&pod={{POD_ID}}&lang={{LANG}}
Cookie: SESSION={{SESSION_ID}}

###
POST {{SELLER_UI_URL}}/spg/content/api/v1/private/content/pages/1/archive?store={{STORE_ID}}&pod={{POD_ID}}&lang={{LANG}}
Cookie: SESSION={{SESSION_ID}}

###
POST {{SELLER_UI_URL}}/spg/content/api/v1/private/content/pages/1/restore?store={{STORE_ID}}&pod={{POD_ID}}&lang={{LANG}}
Cookie: SESSION={{SESSION_ID}}

### Edit one locale only (translator path)
PUT {{SELLER_UI_URL}}/spg/content/api/v1/private/content/pages/1/translations/ar?store={{STORE_ID}}&pod={{POD_ID}}&lang={{LANG}}
Content-Type: application/json
Cookie: SESSION={{SESSION_ID}}

{"title": "الوظائف في أكمي", "body": "<p>نحن نوظّف.</p>"}

### Revisions, and restore one as a new version
GET {{SELLER_UI_URL}}/spg/content/api/v1/private/content/pages/1/revisions?store={{STORE_ID}}&pod={{POD_ID}}&lang={{LANG}}
Cookie: SESSION={{SESSION_ID}}

###
POST {{SELLER_UI_URL}}/spg/content/api/v1/private/content/pages/1/revisions/0/restore?store={{STORE_ID}}&pod={{POD_ID}}&lang={{LANG}}
Cookie: SESSION={{SESSION_ID}}

### Bulk (207 with a per-id result)
POST {{SELLER_UI_URL}}/spg/content/api/v1/private/content/pages/bulk?store={{STORE_ID}}&pod={{POD_ID}}&lang={{LANG}}
Content-Type: application/json
Cookie: SESSION={{SESSION_ID}}

{"ids": [1, 2, 3], "action": "PUBLISH"}

### Delete (409 CONTENT.PAGE.REFERENCED when a menu links it, unless force=true)
DELETE {{SELLER_UI_URL}}/spg/content/api/v1/private/content/pages/1?store={{STORE_ID}}&pod={{POD_ID}}&lang={{LANG}}&force=false
Cookie: SESSION={{SESSION_ID}}
